{"records":[{"timestamp_text":null,"participants":["TX-1"],"summary":"A reconciliation note states that two transaction exports appear to refer to the same TX-1 record. It characterizes this as an administrative comparison rather than a second transfer, preserves the same amount and transaction time, and warns that duplicate exports should not be counted as separate events.","source_refs":[{"source_id":"a-ledger-003","source_locator":"case-a-scale/ledger/reconciliation-note"}]}]}